# Claude Code: stow target is ~/.claude, which Claude fills with runtime state
# (credentials, sessions, caches, history, project data). Ignore everything and
# whitelist only the config that belongs in this repo.
claude/.claude/**
!claude/.claude/settings.json
!claude/.claude/CLAUDE.md
!claude/.claude/hooks/
!claude/.claude/hooks/**
!claude/.claude/agents/
!claude/.claude/agents/**
!claude/.claude/commands/
!claude/.claude/commands/**
!claude/.claude/skills/
!claude/.claude/skills/**
